# Cloudflare Pages response headers.
#
# Content-Security-Policy is deliberately absent: it would be the most valuable
# header here, but it has to enumerate Supabase, the API origin and the image
# CDNs (TMDB, IGDB, Open Library covers), and getting it wrong silently breaks
# the app in ways that are hard to see. Worth adding once the deployed origins
# are known and it can be tested against the real site.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), camera=(), microphone=()
